    <description>Study Onboarding dashboard redesign (2026-10-27): before-save, stamps the matching *_Milestone_Status_Date__c field whenever its paired *_Milestone_Status__c field is set (on create) or changed to a value, for each of 6 onboarding categories (Finance, SSU Packet, IRB, eSource, SIV, Activation Letter). Replaces the auto-generated onboarding Tasks that this org no longer wants created. Internal Greenlight is NOT handled here — the dashboard&apos;s &quot;Greenlight Status&quot; checklist item reads/writes the pre-existing Internal_Greenlight__c / Internal_Greenlight_Date__c fields directly (same field the Est. Internal Greenlight cell uses), since that date is a deliberately-entered actual/target date, not a stamp-on-click timestamp. 2026-11-04: client asked for the portal milestone checkboxes to be uncheckable. When a status field is changed to blank (unchecked), its paired date field is cleared to null instead of being re-stamped to now.</description>
